Node ID=20 new world
Text=Across the blue sea, there is an untamed land, wilder and more alive than any place you have ever seen in Europe. The New World, the Americas, it was supposed to be a land of wealth and dreams. After three expeditions to that accursed land, I can tell you it is a place of nightmares.
